        "f7a882d3eb26c245d9cc1d97f1c156881f16d117"
      ],
      "title": "DNS: Base32-encode NSEC3 Next Hashed Owner Name",
      "message": "DNS: Base32-encode NSEC3 Next Hashed Owner Name\n\nAs the owner name of each NSEC3 record is Base32-encoded, the Next\nHashed Owner Name field in those records should also be displayed in\nBase32-encoded form.  This enables the user to quickly tell what span of\nhashed owner names is covered by a given NSEC3 record.\n",
      "author_name": "Michał Kępień",
      "author_email": "michal@isc.org",
      "authored_date": "2022-01-25T20:58:16.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "A Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
      "committed_date": "2022-01-26T07:48:45.000+00:00",
